Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening. It seems there are some unsettled matters between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you a job, and I arranged an apartment for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In return you'd do me favors now and then,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but you didn't quite finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The top part, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be losing your grip, but then it runs in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're smart, you'll settle this arrangement with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember this?
